[{"text": "Hello English learners and welcome to another lesson with EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.1200000000000039, "end": 6.08}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 6.32, "end": 6.92}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you a great Christmas lesson.", "start": 7.28, "end": 9.9}, {"text": "That's right. We've got a lot of Christmas vocabulary in today's lesson for you.", "start": 10.2, "end": 15.08}, {"text": "Yeah, it's almost Christmas time so everyone is getting into the spirit, especially here at EnglishPod.", "start": 15.38, "end": 19.92}, {"text": "So we're going to teach you a little bit more about this.", "start": 19.92, "end": 22.26}, {"text": "Speaking of the spirit, I think it's time for us to look at our vocabulary preview.", "start": 22.52, "end": 28.02}, {"text": "So in this part of our show, we'll look at some key language in the dialogue that you'll need to know to understand the dialogue.", "start": 30.54, "end": 38.06}, {"text": "And actually today we only have one word.", "start": 38.32, "end": 40.54}, {"text": "Eggnog.", "start": 41.22, "end": 41.78}, {"text": "Eggnog.", "start": 42.56, "end": 43.12}, {"text": "Eggnog.", "start": 43.62, "end": 44.18}, {"text": "E-G-G-N-O-G. Eggnog.", "start": 44.46, "end": 47.46}, {"text": "So eggnog is a really popular Christmas drink.", "start": 47.66, "end": 51.02}, {"text": "It's a traditional Christmas drink.", "start": 51.24, "end": 52.76}, {"text": "Right. What is it made of?", "start": 53.02, "end": 54.16}, {"text": "Eggs, cream, sugar, and usually rum.", "start": 55.66, "end": 59.66}, {"text": "Rum. Oh, so it has alcohol.", "start": 60.06, "end": 61.64}, {"text": "Yeah, normally it has alcohol.", "start": 62.08, "end": 63.72}, {"text": "Okay. All right. That's interesting.", "start": 64.1, "end": 65.84}, {"text": "There's actually a drink very similar to this in Chile.", "start": 66.04, "end": 69.24}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 69.52, "end": 69.7}, {"text": "Yep. They call it monkey tail.", "start": 70.04, "end": 72.08}, {"text": "So in Spanish that would be?", "start": 72.34, "end": 74.0}, {"text": "Cola de mono.", "start": 74.12, "end": 74.74}, {"text": "Very nice.", "start": 75.02, "end": 75.5}, {"text": "Yeah. So it's actually really, really good.", "start": 76.36, "end": 78.44}, {"text": "And it's really similar to eggnog.", "start": 78.58, "end": 79.82}, {"text": "Okay. Well, with that in mind, let's take a listen to our dialogue for the first time.", "start": 79.82, "end": 84.82}, {"text": "I hate working on Christmas Eve.", "start": 93.42, "end": 95.1}, {"text": "Whoa! Get a load of this guy.", "start": 96.78, "end": 98.56}, {"text": "Come in, Central. I think we got ourselves a situation here.", "start": 98.86, "end": 101.34}, {"text": "30 a.m. Christmas Eve.", "start": 101.34, "end": 103.26}, {"text": "I'm out with the gangsters and bees.", "start": 103.26, "end": 104.82}, {"text": "Celebrating posted over here.", "start": 105.06, "end": 106.74}, {"text": "Throwing in and muck in my cup.", "start": 106.86, "end": 108.16}, {"text": "Oh, I'm a first-tail bag.", "start": 108.52, "end": 110.24}, {"text": "License and registration, please.", "start": 116.26, "end": 117.76}, {"text": "Have you been drinking tonight, sir?", "start": 118.72, "end": 120.24}, {"text": "I had one or two glasses of eggnog, but nothing else.", "start": 121.24000000000001, "end": 125.2}, {"text": "Step out of the vehicle, please.", "start": 125.84, "end": 127.18}, {"text": "Sir, what do you have in the back?", "start": 127.6, "end": 129.14}, {"text": "Just a few Christmas gifts.", "start": 130.0, "end": 132.1}, {"text": "Tis the season, after all.", "start": 132.34, "end": 134.04}, {"text": "Don't take that tone with me.", "start": 134.32, "end": 135.58}, {"text": "Do you have an invoice for these items?", "start": 136.06, "end": 137.56}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 138.5, "end": 139.54}, {"text": "I make these in my workshop in the North Pole.", "start": 139.96, "end": 143.28}, {"text": "You are under arrest, sir.", "start": 143.56, "end": 145.3}, {"text": "You have the right to remain silent.", "start": 145.5, "end": 147.06}, {"text": "You better not pout.", "start": 147.28, "end": 148.2}, {"text": "You better not cry.", "start": 148.3, "end": 149.16}, {"text": "Anything you say can and will be used against you.", "start": 149.46, "end": 152.18}, {"text": "You have the right to an attorney.", "start": 152.32, "end": 153.38}, {"text": "If you can't afford one, the state will appoint one for you.", "start": 153.56, "end": 156.12}, {"text": "Do you understand these rights that have just been read to you?", "start": 156.28, "end": 158.36}, {"text": "You can't take me to jail.", "start": 158.36, "end": 160.52}, {"text": "What about my sleigh?", "start": 160.76, "end": 162.38}, {"text": "It's Christmas Eve.", "start": 162.56, "end": 163.68}, {"text": "I have presents to deliver.", "start": 163.86, "end": 165.4}, {"text": "Rudolph, prancer, dancer, get help.", "start": 165.82, "end": 168.74}, {"text": "Well, I did not see that one coming.", "start": 185.16000000000003, "end": 187.66}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 188.12, "end": 188.42}, {"text": "That was interesting.", "start": 188.9, "end": 189.96}, {"text": "Santa Claus is being taken to jail.", "start": 190.2, "end": 192.3}, {"text": "What's going to happen next, Marco?", "start": 192.66, "end": 194.2}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 194.52, "end": 195.14}, {"text": "We'll talk about that in a little while.", "start": 195.14, "end": 196.62}, {"text": "Let's take a look at some language from this dialogue.", "start": 196.8, "end": 199.18}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 200.92000000000002, "end": 201.88}, {"text": "So the first word that we have on our language takeaway today is vehicle.", "start": 203.14000000000001, "end": 207.04}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 207.78, "end": 208.26}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 208.7, "end": 209.18}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 209.38, "end": 209.86}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 209.86, "end": 210.0}, {"text": "So this is a vehicle.", "start": 210.72000000000003, "end": 212.44}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 214.84, "end": 216.24}, {"text": "produced by user.", "start": 216.24, "end": 218.02}, {"text": "And this is a vehicle.", "start": 222.8, "end": 225.28}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 230.04, "end": 230.7}, {"text": "And this is a vehicle.", "start": 235.18, "end": 237.68}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 238.88, "end": 240.12}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 240.12, "end": 240.76}, {"text": "Vehicle.", "start": 241.02, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "", "start": 242.42, "end": 242.42}, {"text": "So all of those are vehicles.", "start": 250.2, "end": 252.12}, {"text": "Now, I thought that a vehicle was a car specifically.", "start": 252.54, "end": 255.22}, {"text": "No, any machine that carries people from one place to another is a vehicle.", "start": 255.6, "end": 260.18}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 260.42, "end": 260.84}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 261.1, "end": 261.44}, {"text": "Let's take a look now at our second word, attorney.", "start": 261.8, "end": 264.86}, {"text": "Attorney.", "start": 265.56, "end": 266.12}, {"text": "Attorney.", "start": 266.6, "end": 267.06}, {"text": "So what is an attorney?", "start": 267.58, "end": 268.94}, {"text": "A lawyer.", "start": 269.32, "end": 270.02}, {"text": "Well, that's simple enough.", "start": 270.4, "end": 271.6}, {"text": "Yeah, a lawyer.", "start": 271.76, "end": 272.42}, {"text": "Let's move to our third word, which is?", "start": 272.44, "end": 275.48}, {"text": "Appoint.", "start": 275.82, "end": 276.46}, {"text": "Appoint.", "start": 276.98, "end": 277.62}, {"text": "Appoint.", "start": 277.98, "end": 278.62}, {"text": "Appoint.", "start": 279.1, "end": 279.74}, {"text": "So appoint means choose.", "start": 280.06, "end": 281.62}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 282.24, "end": 282.62}, {"text": "So the president of a country might appoint his chief of staff.", "start": 282.76, "end": 287.36}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 287.6, "end": 288.14}, {"text": "Or I can appoint my attorney.", "start": 288.14, "end": 291.1}, {"text": "True.", "start": 291.42, "end": 291.62}, {"text": "So can you appoint a thing?", "start": 291.86, "end": 294.04}, {"text": "Can I appoint my coffee cup?", "start": 294.22, "end": 296.0}, {"text": "No, no.", "start": 296.6, "end": 297.5}, {"text": "You only use it for people.", "start": 297.68, "end": 299.04}, {"text": "You choose someone.", "start": 299.2, "end": 300.06}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 300.22, "end": 300.6}, {"text": "You can't choose something.", "start": 300.7, "end": 301.26}, {"text": "So I appoint someone.", "start": 301.26, "end": 302.54}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 302.82, "end": 303.18}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 303.56, "end": 303.76}, {"text": "Let's move to our final word.", "start": 303.82, "end": 305.02}, {"text": "Sleigh.", "start": 305.48, "end": 305.96}, {"text": "Sleigh.", "start": 306.58, "end": 307.18}, {"text": "Sleigh.", "start": 307.58, "end": 308.18}, {"text": "Sleigh.", "start": 308.42, "end": 308.84}, {"text": "So Erica, you're from Canada.", "start": 309.4, "end": 311.2}, {"text": "You can tell us about sleighs.", "start": 311.2, "end": 312.48}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 312.7, "end": 312.96}, {"text": "A sleigh is a vehicle that is pulled by a horse and travels over snow or ice.", "start": 313.06, "end": 320.42}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 320.68, "end": 320.94}, {"text": "So, you know, like Santa drives a sleigh.", "start": 320.94, "end": 323.5}, {"text": "He drives a sleigh.", "start": 323.64, "end": 324.52}, {"text": "So do you drive a sleigh or ride a sleigh?", "start": 324.64, "end": 326.42}, {"text": "Good question.", "start": 327.66, "end": 328.46}, {"text": "Well, the song says you ride in a one-horse open sleigh.", "start": 329.5, "end": 332.92}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 333.04, "end": 333.3}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 333.48, "end": 333.72}, {"text": "Well, you know what?", "start": 333.98, "end": 334.6}, {"text": "I think it's time for us to look at some interesting phrases that we found in this dialogue.", "start": 334.6, "end": 339.3}, {"text": "So let's look at putting it together.", "start": 339.3, "end": 341.02}, {"text": "Putting it together.", "start": 342.78, "end": 343.9}, {"text": "Today on putting it together, we have two great phrases for you.", "start": 345.16, "end": 348.14}, {"text": "And let's take a look at the first one.", "start": 348.28, "end": 350.3}, {"text": "Step out.", "start": 350.5, "end": 351.32}, {"text": "Step out.", "start": 351.56, "end": 352.46}, {"text": "Step out.", "start": 352.9, "end": 353.74}, {"text": "So step out means to go out of a place for a short period of time.", "start": 353.74, "end": 358.96}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 359.3, "end": 359.84}, {"text": "So in our dialogue, for example, the police officer said, step out of the vehicle.", "start": 360.06, "end": 365.7}, {"text": "Get out of your vehicle.", "start": 365.88, "end": 366.92}, {"text": "You can also say, step out of the office.", "start": 367.16, "end": 369.94}, {"text": "You can say, I just stepped out of the shower.", "start": 370.26, "end": 373.02}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 373.48, "end": 373.88}, {"text": "Now, we can also say, step in.", "start": 374.14, "end": 376.66}, {"text": "It's the opposite.", "start": 376.88, "end": 377.68}, {"text": "The opposite, right?", "start": 377.94, "end": 378.76}, {"text": "I can ask Marco, step into my office for a moment.", "start": 378.96, "end": 382.14}, {"text": "Uh-oh.", "start": 382.36, "end": 382.84}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 383.56, "end": 384.0}, {"text": "So that's step out and step in.", "start": 384.8, "end": 387.0}, {"text": "Great phrases.", "start": 387.18, "end": 387.76}, {"text": "Let's take a look at our final phrase.", "start": 388.06, "end": 389.5}, {"text": "Get a load of.", "start": 390.12, "end": 391.22}, {"text": "Get a load of.", "start": 391.4, "end": 392.82}, {"text": "Get a load of.", "start": 393.08, "end": 394.3}, {"text": "So when I say get a load of something, I mean look at, right?", "start": 394.46, "end": 398.64}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 398.86, "end": 399.26}, {"text": "Look at this guy.", "start": 399.4, "end": 400.18}, {"text": "Get a load of this guy.", "start": 400.44, "end": 401.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 401.66, "end": 401.86}, {"text": "That's what we heard in the dialogue.", "start": 401.98, "end": 402.96}, {"text": "Now, you can use this phrase in a number of different ways.", "start": 403.18, "end": 405.68}, {"text": "And we have some examples for you.", "start": 405.68, "end": 407.46}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 408.8, "end": 409.6}, {"text": "Give a load of this.", "start": 412.16, "end": 413.44}, {"text": "A war has started in Antarctica.", "start": 413.58, "end": 415.0}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 417.12, "end": 418.02}, {"text": "Get a load of that house.", "start": 420.18, "end": 421.74}, {"text": "It's so big.", "start": 421.9, "end": 422.96}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 426.44, "end": 427.4}, {"text": "Give a load of him.", "start": 430.34000000000003, "end": 431.46}, {"text": "He's wearing a pink suit.", "start": 431.68, "end": 433.08}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 435.58000000000004, "end": 436.1}, {"text": "I think we've covered a lot of interesting words and phrases.", "start": 436.1, "end": 439.2}, {"text": "So we are ready to listen to our dialogue a second time.", "start": 439.2, "end": 442.42}, {"text": "But this time it's going to be a little bit slower so we can pick up all these great words.", "start": 442.42, "end": 446.86}, {"text": "I hate working on Christmas Eve.", "start": 449.56, "end": 452.34}, {"text": "Whoa.", "start": 453.46000000000004, "end": 453.98}, {"text": "Get a load of this guy.", "start": 454.46, "end": 455.56}, {"text": "Come in central.", "start": 456.24, "end": 457.38}, {"text": "I think we got ourselves a situation here.", "start": 458.3, "end": 460.52}, {"text": "License and registration, please.", "start": 462.44, "end": 464.18}, {"text": "Have you been drinking tonight, sir?", "start": 464.76, "end": 466.4}, {"text": "I had one or two glasses of eggnog, but nothing else.", "start": 467.65999999999997, "end": 473.9}, {"text": "Step out of the vehicle, please.", "start": 474.34, "end": 475.94}, {"text": "Sir, what do you have in the back?", "start": 476.54, "end": 478.3}, {"text": "Just a few Christmas gifts.", "start": 479.36, "end": 481.8}, {"text": "Tis the season, after all.", "start": 482.1, "end": 484.2}, {"text": "Don't take that tone with me.", "start": 484.82, "end": 486.36}, {"text": "Do you have an invoice for these items?", "start": 486.52, "end": 488.24}, {"text": "Um, no.", "start": 489.72, "end": 491.42}, {"text": "I make these in my workshop in the North Pole.", "start": 492.1, "end": 496.3}, {"text": "You are under arrest, sir.", "start": 496.92, "end": 499.18}, {"text": "You have the right to remain silent.", "start": 499.18, "end": 501.3}, {"text": "You better not pout.", "start": 501.6, "end": 502.74}, {"text": "You better not cry.", "start": 502.86, "end": 503.9}, {"text": "Anything you say can and will be used against you.", "start": 504.12, "end": 507.8}, {"text": "You have the right to an attorney.", "start": 507.96, "end": 509.58}, {"text": "If you cannot afford one, the state will appoint one for you.", "start": 509.8, "end": 513.6}, {"text": "Do you understand all these rights that have just been read to you?", "start": 513.76, "end": 517.34}, {"text": "You can't take me to jail.", "start": 517.34, "end": 520.1}, {"text": "What about my sleigh?", "start": 520.46, "end": 522.42}, {"text": "It's Christmas Eve.", "start": 522.7, "end": 524.24}, {"text": "I have presents to deliver.", "start": 524.24, "end": 526.42}, {"text": "Rudolph, prancer, dancer, get help.", "start": 527.04, "end": 530.96}, {"text": "Okay, so we noticed some really great words and phrases.", "start": 534.4, "end": 537.6}, {"text": "And with this, now we can start with some Fluency Builder.", "start": 537.6, "end": 541.44}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 542.36, "end": 543.6}, {"text": "Today on Fluency Builder, we have two great phrases that you can use to sound a little bit", "start": 543.6, "end": 550.12}, {"text": "more natural when you speak.", "start": 550.12, "end": 551.4}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 551.56, "end": 551.98}, {"text": "Our first phrase you can use if you want to say, don't speak to me like that.", "start": 551.98, "end": 558.28}, {"text": "Don't take that tone with me.", "start": 560.08, "end": 561.56}, {"text": "Don't take that tone with me.", "start": 563.24, "end": 564.68}, {"text": "So you often hear this phrase coming out of the mouth of a mother or a father.", "start": 565.96, "end": 571.0}, {"text": "Yeah, when their children are maybe talking back.", "start": 571.34, "end": 574.04}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 574.36, "end": 574.56}, {"text": "Don't take that tone with me, young man.", "start": 574.92, "end": 576.7}, {"text": "I used to get that a lot.", "start": 576.9, "end": 578.0}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 578.16, "end": 578.38}, {"text": "Sorry about that.", "start": 578.72, "end": 579.68}, {"text": "Okay, our second phrase.", "start": 580.74, "end": 582.56}, {"text": "We use it when we have a problem.", "start": 582.82, "end": 585.16}, {"text": "The phrase we heard in the dialogue was,", "start": 585.42, "end": 587.94}, {"text": "I think we've got ourselves the situation here.", "start": 588.12, "end": 591.3}, {"text": "Let's listen to another example.", "start": 592.1, "end": 593.88}, {"text": "Houston, we've got ourselves a situation here.", "start": 594.8000000000001, "end": 597.4}, {"text": "Houston, we've got ourselves a situation here.", "start": 599.34, "end": 601.96}, {"text": "Sometimes I use this phrase when I want to tell my boss that I have a problem.", "start": 603.6, "end": 608.16}, {"text": "I might say, boss, I've got a bit of a situation.", "start": 608.36, "end": 612.46}, {"text": "Can you help me with it?", "start": 612.46, "end": 613.72}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 614.1, "end": 614.4}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 614.68, "end": 614.8}, {"text": "I have a little bit of a problem.", "start": 614.8, "end": 616.22}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 616.48, "end": 616.66}, {"text": "Useful phrases, hey?", "start": 617.04, "end": 618.04}, {"text": "Really useful phrases.", "start": 618.24, "end": 619.32}, {"text": "Great stuff.", "start": 619.62, "end": 620.06}, {"text": "So now we can listen to our dialogue a final time.", "start": 620.06, "end": 622.64}, {"text": "And this time we can understand everything that's in it.", "start": 622.84, "end": 626.02}, {"text": "I hate working on Christmas Eve.", "start": 634.9, "end": 636.64}, {"text": "Whoa, get a load of this guy.", "start": 638.26, "end": 640.06}, {"text": "Come in, Central.", "start": 640.38, "end": 641.18}, {"text": "I think we've got ourselves a situation here.", "start": 641.36, "end": 642.86}, {"text": "30 a.m. Christmas Eve.", "start": 642.86, "end": 644.8}, {"text": "I'm out with the gadgets and these.", "start": 644.96, "end": 646.32}, {"text": "I celebrate it, post it over here.", "start": 646.56, "end": 648.26}, {"text": "Going in and put it in my cup.", "start": 648.4, "end": 649.66}, {"text": "Hold on, post it in my cup.", "start": 650.06, "end": 651.76}, {"text": "Hold on, post it in my cup.", "start": 651.76, "end": 651.92}, {"text": "Hold on, post it in my cup.", "start": 653.9000000000001, "end": 654.74}, {"text": "License and registration, please.", "start": 657.88, "end": 659.28}, {"text": "Have you been drinking tonight, sir?", "start": 660.32, "end": 661.76}, {"text": "I had one or two glasses of eggnog, but nothing else.", "start": 662.76, "end": 666.74}, {"text": "Step out of the vehicle, please.", "start": 667.38, "end": 668.7}, {"text": "Sir, what do you have in the back?", "start": 669.24, "end": 670.68}, {"text": "Just a few Christmas gifts.", "start": 671.48, "end": 673.6}, {"text": "Tis the season, after all.", "start": 673.96, "end": 675.54}, {"text": "Don't take that tone with me.", "start": 675.82, "end": 677.1}, {"text": "Do you have an invoice for these items?", "start": 677.68, "end": 679.1}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 680.08, "end": 681.06}, {"text": "I make these in my workshop in the North Pole.", "start": 681.54, "end": 684.82}, {"text": "You are under arrest, sir.", "start": 684.82, "end": 686.82}, {"text": "You have the right to remain silent.", "start": 687.12, "end": 688.6}, {"text": "You better not pout.", "start": 688.8, "end": 689.72}, {"text": "You better not cry.", "start": 689.82, "end": 690.68}, {"text": "Anything you say can and will be used against you.", "start": 691.06, "end": 693.7}, {"text": "You have the right to an attorney.", "start": 693.86, "end": 694.9}, {"text": "If you can't afford one, the state will appoint one for you.", "start": 695.1, "end": 697.66}, {"text": "Do you understand these rights that have just been read to you?", "start": 697.78, "end": 699.88}, {"text": "You can't take me to jail.", "start": 700.2, "end": 702.08}, {"text": "What about my sleigh?", "start": 702.34, "end": 703.92}, {"text": "It's Christmas Eve.", "start": 704.06, "end": 705.2}, {"text": "I have presents to deliver.", "start": 705.38, "end": 706.92}, {"text": "Rudolph, prancer, dancer, get help.", "start": 707.36, "end": 710.28}, {"text": "He's coming straight to the ghetto.", "start": 716.84, "end": 718.84}, {"text": "So when the police officer was arresting Santa Claus,", "start": 727.0, "end": 731.06}, {"text": "he said something a little bit strange, hey?", "start": 731.22, "end": 733.24}, {"text": "Yeah, he said, you better not pout.", "start": 733.58, "end": 735.38}, {"text": "You better not cry.", "start": 735.5, "end": 736.34}, {"text": "Now, are those part of the normal rights that a police officer reads?", "start": 736.56, "end": 740.56}, {"text": "No, no.", "start": 740.92, "end": 741.72}, {"text": "They're not part of the normal rights.", "start": 741.92, "end": 743.7}, {"text": "It's actually from a Christmas song, so let's listen to how it goes in the song.", "start": 743.7, "end": 747.42}, {"text": "I'm pretty happy we had a song to play there instead of us having to sing.", "start": 764.96, "end": 768.4}, {"text": "Yeah, but that's great because if the children cry or if they are not good kids,", "start": 768.4, "end": 774.1}, {"text": "then Santa Claus will not give them presents.", "start": 774.24, "end": 776.28}, {"text": "Uh-oh.", "start": 776.5, "end": 776.88}, {"text": "So that's why.", "start": 777.08, "end": 778.48}, {"text": "Okay, listeners, I hope that you're not pouting.", "start": 778.78, "end": 780.94}, {"text": "I hope you're not crying.", "start": 780.94, "end": 782.22}, {"text": "But it's time for us to go, so...", "start": 782.58, "end": 785.4}, {"text": "Be sure to go to our website at englishpod.com", "start": 786.04, "end": 788.96}, {"text": "and be sure to leave all your questions and comments", "start": 788.96, "end": 792.8}, {"text": "and maybe some of your Christmas stories.", "start": 792.8, "end": 795.12}, {"text": "All right, thanks for listening and until next time, goodbye.", "start": 795.12, "end": 798.48}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 799.24, "end": 799.44}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 799.58, "end": 799.82}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 800.4, "end": 800.56}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 801.18, "end": 801.66}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 802.12, "end": 802.54}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 803.08, "end": 803.58}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 803.68, "end": 803.9}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 804.02, "end": 804.38}, {"text": "", "start": 806.02, "end": 806.02}, {"text": "", "start": 806.02, "end": 806.02}, {"text": "", "start": 806.34, "end": 806.34}, {"text": "", "start": 806.34, "end": 806.34}, {"text": "", "start": 806.34, "end": 806.34}, {"text": "", "start": 806.34, "end": 806.34}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 806.52, "end": 806.9}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 806.9, "end": 806.94}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 806.94, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.12}, {"text": "", "start": 807.12, "end": 807.1